  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Financing Green Development in Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a joint initiative of the Ministry of Finance of the Republic of Uzbekistan and UNDP. It is aimed to support the Government of Uzbekistan in establishing an integrated approach towards identification, assessment, and integration of potential sources of financing for achieving the country&#x2019;s green priorities and objectives. This approach will be operationalized by streamlining and using public finances more effectively, attracting and expanding private and international financing, a</narrative>
  </description>
